    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Daniel,\n\nMy last note asked where your team's records and updates live. Thinking about your role leading DK Law, the more useful question may be whether that information helps you see what still needs attention, without reviewing every message yourself.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould a list of unanswered client questions or overdue provider follow-ups be more valuable to you? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Ariel W. submitted a Yelp review about DK Law",
